    <!-- ============ PRICING ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricingTitle">
      <div class="container split">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
          <h2 id="pricingTitle">Low entry cost. No hourly rates.</h2>
          <p class="lead" style="margin:0.9rem 0 1.2rem">A "from" price to start, then a fixed quote for your scope before we build — you pay for the outcome, not the hours.</p>
          <p class="callout"><strong>Nothing to pay until you accept a fixed quote.</strong> Then a 40% deposit gets the build going and comes off your project price; the balance is due on completion. Or pay monthly instead: <strong>R249 a month</strong>, nothing upfront except the first month.</p>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
            <a href="start" class="btn btn--primary">Get an estimate</a>
            <a href="pricing" class="btn btn--ghost">Full price list</a>
          </div>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">A live site needs hosting — from R50 a month (R500 a year) to stay online (short-term for events). You own your domain. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing#care">See plans</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <ul class="price-list">
            <li><a href="services#websites">Business website<small>Up to 4–5 pages, custom layout</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
            <li><a href="services#dashboards">Dashboards &amp; automation<small>Built around your real data and processes</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R7,500</span></li>
            <li><a href="services#ai">AI integrations<small>API usage billed separately</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R5,900</span></li>
            <li><a href="services#software">Custom software<small>Larger applications quoted individually</small></a><span class="price"><small>from</small>R17,500</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="process" aria-labelledby="processTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
          <h2 id="processTitle">From problem to launch, without the runaround.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps steps--tight reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Tell us what you need</h3><p>In your own words, in the Project Builder. You see an indicative price on the spot.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>Get a fixed quote</h3><p>We review it and send a fixed quote online &mdash; scope, price and date &mdash; usually within 1 working day.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Accept &amp; pay the deposit</h3><p>Happy with it? Accept online and pay the 40% deposit by card. It comes off your total.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Build &amp; launch</h3><p>We build, you review, the balance is paid on completion and it goes live.</p></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="section__foot btn-row btn-row--center reveal">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="start">Get a price</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="pricing">See pricing &amp; the deposit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

