    <!-- ============ TRUST ============ -->
    <section class="section section--dark" id="why" aria-labelledby="whyTitle">
      <div class="container trust">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">How this works</span>
          <h2 id="whyTitle">An in-house developer, without the in-house part.</h2>
          <blockquote>You message us and we answer. <em>No account manager, no ticket number, no junior you&rsquo;ve never met doing the actual work.</em></blockquote>
          <p class="muted">A business your size can&rsquo;t justify a developer on the payroll, and an agency will put you at the bottom of someone&rsquo;s list. We&rsquo;re the middle option: one person who learns how your business runs and stays with it.</p>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
            <a href="start" class="btn btn--light">Tell us what you need</a>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--free" data-mockup-open>Get a mockup <span class="btn__tag">Free</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="trust__points reveal">
          <li><strong>One developer, start to finish</strong><span>The person who quotes it is the person who builds it.</span></li>
          <li><strong>We learn your business</strong><span>Built around how you actually work, not a template.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Fixed price, not hours</strong><span>A fixed quote before we build. You pay for the outcome.</span></li>
          <li><strong>You own it</strong><span>Your domain, your data, your code. We keep it running.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->
    <section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="aboutTitle">
      <div class="container about__inner">
        <div class="about__media reveal">
          <div class="about__photo about__photo--brand">
            <img src="assets/brand/mark.svg" alt="Re-Charge" width="120" height="114" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <p class="about__name">Independent developer<span>Re-Charge &middot; South Africa</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="about__copy reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
          <h2 id="aboutTitle">Who you’ll be dealing with.</h2>
          <p>We started Re-Charge to do one thing: help small South African businesses show up online and work smarter, without the agency price tag or the runaround. When you message Re-Charge, you're talking to the developer who builds your website, sets up your AI, and answers when something needs fixing. No call centre, no account manager, no handoffs.</p>
          <p>The name is the whole idea. Plenty of good businesses are running on a website from 2009, or a quote process held together by phone calls and paper. We bring them up to date — re-charge them — with modern websites and practical AI, at prices a small business can actually afford.</p>
          <p class="about__values">Fixed prices. A reply within the hour. Built around your business, not a template.</p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a href="start" class="btn btn--primary">Start a project with us</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn--ghost" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Questions</span>
          <h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>How quickly will you reply, and how quickly is my site live?</summary>
            <p>We reply within an hour, every day from 7am to 9pm (messages after 9pm get a reply by 8am). Once you approve the design and we have your logo, photos and prices, your website is live within 7 days, or your first month of Care is free. <a class="inline-link" href="terms#promises">The details</a></p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>How much does a project cost?</summary>
            <p>One-page websites start from R1,000, a business website from R2,000, and custom websites from R4,500. Dashboards and automation start from R7,500, AI assistants from R5,900 and custom tools from R17,500. You see an indicative estimate before you pay, and a fixed quote once we’ve reviewed your project.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>When do I pay the deposit?</summary>
            <p><strong>Only once you've seen and accepted your fixed quote.</strong> Tell us what you need (free), we send you a fixed quote online with the scope, price and timeline, and if you're happy you accept it and pay the deposit by card. It comes off your project price, and the balance is due on completion. Don't like the quote? Don't accept it — you haven't paid anything.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>What if I don't know what I need?</summary>
            <p>That's completely fine, and it's a normal way to start. Tell us what you're currently doing, what's frustrating you, or what you'd like to improve. We’ll work out what could be built to solve it. You don't need any technical terms.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq__item">
            <summary>What about AI running costs?</summary>
            <p>Third-party AI/API usage is billed separately, based on actual usage, and we explain it before we build anything. We never bundle unlimited AI usage into a fixed project price.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FINAL CTA ============ -->
    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">Websites · Dashboards · Automation · AI · Custom Software</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Have a problem worth solving?</h2>
        <p>Describe it in a few sentences and see an estimate straight away.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a href="start" class="btn btn--light btn--large">Start a Project</a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--free btn--large" data-mockup-open>Get a mockup <span class="btn__tag">Free</span></button>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted">Not ready to commit? The mockup costs nothing — no deposit, no obligation. <a class="inline-link" href="demos">See what we build →</a></p>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Prefer to talk first? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

